WEBVTT

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
FANSUB GROUP AZALIA PRESENTS

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
Worked on the series:
Lily, Tiramisu, Biryulka, Host, Hazelnut, February

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
How did I become

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
queen

00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:06.330
All characters are fictitious

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:08.610
and the events shown are fiction.

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:11.940
If you don't want to talk,

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:13.810
do we use hand signals?

00:01:13.060 --> 02:01:37.060
AZALEA

00:01:13.810 --> 00:01:14.810
For example, this one.

00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:16.980
What is this?

00:01:16.980 --> 00:01:20.250
This means that I'm lying about everything.

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:22.680
What do you say? It's not difficult, is it?

00:01:28.190 --> 00:01:31.020
The king never lies.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:36.930
Episode 15

00:01:55.350 --> 00:01:58.120
What sin could such a young child commit?

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:02.460
The smell of alcohol and something else.

00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:04.690
She didn't drink poison.

00:02:05.930 --> 00:02:11.630
I can't believe she was forced to drink poison with those tiny hands.

00:02:13.470 --> 00:02:15.970
Hands are warm. She's still alive.

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:24.380
Get up.

00:02:25.210 --> 00:02:27.450
Damhyang!

00:02:31.490 --> 00:02:32.520
Your Majesty.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:48.800
-Mr.
-You are here.

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:49.900
Mister.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:52.070
Hold it.

00:02:56.510 --> 00:02:59.150
You cannot leave your child in the mountains.

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:02.650
I have to give her a funeral.

00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:14.860
-Goodbye.
-Goodbye.

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:37.180
How's Damhyang doing? Is she okay?

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:39.890
She had already left the palace safely.

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:42.820
I had mercy on her servant mother

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:45.730
and prepared everything so that they would leave Hanyang together.

00:03:45.730 --> 00:03:47.130
So she will meet her mother.

00:03:47.930 --> 00:03:50.060
Damhyang was very worried about her.

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:52.930
What a joy. This is cool.

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:58.740
How did you pull this off? Did you give her sleeping pills?

00:03:58.770 --> 00:04:00.340
She was given mafeisan to drink.

00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:05.080
Mafeisan, what did Hua Tuo use during operations?

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:06.350
You know him.

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:09.020
Certainly. I have read The Three Kingdoms for Children many times.

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:11.320
Three Kingdoms for children?

00:04:13.090 --> 00:04:16.420
Listen to me. You should have warned me.

00:04:16.420 --> 00:04:18.230
The matter was urgent

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:20.230
It was dangerous to involve many people.

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:27.270
Any news from Mr. Hong?

00:04:27.470 --> 00:04:31.040
Yes. He made sure the child escaped safely.

00:04:32.940 --> 00:04:34.340
Well done.

00:04:35.380 --> 00:04:38.580
Recklessly putting yourself in danger

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:40.380
because of the maid.

00:04:40.550 --> 00:04:42.320
She's not just a maid.

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:44.920
If I gave up my child,

00:04:46.020 --> 00:04:48.390
it would be easier to give up 10, 100,

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:52.490
and then all my people.

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:57.100
I thought Cheoljong was an ordinary fool,

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:00.470
and he's just an incredible fool.

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:02.970
Don't spend a lot of time thinking about great things.

00:05:02.970 --> 00:05:04.170
Otherwise you won't live long.

00:05:04.770 --> 00:05:07.370
I don't intend to live a miserable life.

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:09.410
A perfect excuse for an early death.

00:05:09.880 --> 00:05:11.510
Yes, because of whom is he...

00:05:11.510 --> 00:05:12.980
This is how she thanks me.

00:05:14.010 --> 00:05:16.920
The Queen speaks differently than others.

00:05:19.520 --> 00:05:21.420
The Queen's Dictionary came in handy.

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:23.520
It is full of loose and incorrect translations.

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:25.660
-Have you seen him?
-You left it open.

00:05:26.690 --> 00:05:30.260
By the way, is the queen's position always this dangerous?

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:32.130
Why does everyone want to kill me?

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:35.600
I won't let this happen again.

00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:38.870
No. I'll take care of everything myself.

00:05:39.740 --> 00:05:41.740
The best defense is attack.

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:47.050
From this day on, I will become the most reckless one in the palace.

00:06:02.760 --> 00:06:05.770
Crazy X is here

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:14.770
Have you tried to get rid of the queen?

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:17.440
The queen is on the king's side.

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:20.350
She told him about all the weaknesses of our family.

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:23.380
She fell in love with the king and turned away from us.

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:25.520
This is not true.

00:06:26.350 --> 00:06:28.090
You don't want to believe

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:31.260
that the queen you adore

00:06:31.260 --> 00:06:33.060
just a stupid woman

00:06:33.060 --> 00:06:34.830
recklessly in love with a man.

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:37.800
Having joined your family,

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:40.670
I did everything you wanted to be accepted.

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:44.910
Not just to stay in this house.

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:47.110
I wanted to be like you

00:06:48.140 --> 00:06:49.880
had respect for you.

00:06:51.780 --> 00:06:54.480
But trying to harm the queen

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:58.290
you are no longer my father.

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:04.220
If anyone decides to threaten the queen,

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:09.200
I will definitely cut his throat.

00:07:14.940 --> 00:07:17.000
You can come home whenever you want.

00:07:19.010 --> 00:07:21.440
Even if you don't consider me a father,

00:07:22.640 --> 00:07:24.980
you will always be my son.

00:07:36.860 --> 00:07:40.160
Who could have hidden the ledger in Daejojeon?

00:07:40.690 --> 00:07:42.730
The main suspects are

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:44.760
those two who harbored a grudge against me.

00:07:45.470 --> 00:07:47.270
The Queen Mother and Cho Hwajin.

00:07:47.670 --> 00:07:50.170
The motive points to Cho Hwajin.

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:00.950
I'm almost sure, considering
how she behaved during the hunt.

00:08:02.650 --> 00:08:05.850
However, Hwajin had not come to Daejojong for a long time.

00:08:06.190 --> 00:08:08.790
Methods point to the Queen Mother.

00:08:10.360 --> 00:08:11.520
Here.

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:16.360
She comes here suspiciously often lately.

00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:19.400
Of course, she also has a motive.

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:21.800
Is this the Queen Mother?

00:08:22.240 --> 00:08:23.800
This little rat.

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:29.640
How did the Queen Mother get her hands on the ledger?

00:08:32.180 --> 00:08:35.680
That's the mystery.

00:08:36.150 --> 00:08:40.590
And more importantly, what kind of ledger is this?

00:09:02.840 --> 00:09:04.910
I didn't perform the ritual today.

00:09:04.910 --> 00:09:07.350
I apologize for my rude behavior.

00:09:09.020 --> 00:09:11.380
You're apologizing for a reason.

00:09:12.350 --> 00:09:13.890
What is the reason?

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:16.660
As I expected

00:09:17.920 --> 00:09:19.960
you grasp everything on the fly.

00:09:27.530 --> 00:09:31.370
Thank you for participating in this unpleasant meeting.

00:09:35.110 --> 00:09:37.740
I'm sure in light of recent events you understand

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:39.510
that the time has come to know

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:41.310
unite families.

00:09:42.250 --> 00:09:43.520
We are closely connected.

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:46.890
If one of the two families falls,

00:09:47.220 --> 00:09:49.320
the other will not stay afloat.

00:09:52.660 --> 00:09:57.100
Therefore, I propose to issue a decree on amnesty,

00:09:57.960 --> 00:09:59.500
as a guarantee of harmony in relationships.

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:02.070
Decree?

00:10:02.070 --> 00:10:04.300
Many talents from both families

00:10:04.300 --> 00:10:07.340
lost their posts due to a momentary mistake.

00:10:07.840 --> 00:10:11.440
We will issue an amnesty decree to pardon these people.

00:10:12.550 --> 00:10:15.520
In other words, it is a symbol of promise

00:10:15.520 --> 00:10:17.050
and a congratulatory gift.

00:10:17.550 --> 00:10:18.690
What do you say?

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:22.160
Can you support me on this?

00:10:50.320 --> 00:10:54.220
The War Department used dirty tricks to satisfy their greed,

00:10:54.220 --> 00:10:58.260
and I am guilty of not being able to subdue him.

00:10:58.890 --> 00:11:01.590
In this regard, I, Kim Jwageun,

00:11:02.400 --> 00:11:05.530
I ask for resignation from my post.

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:14.440
It's not over yet for me.

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:16.840
It won't end as long as I breathe.

00:11:37.660 --> 00:11:39.130
Eat more slowly.

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:43.040
Are there enough snacks?

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:56.250
I shouldn't eat if I have even an ounce of shame left in me.

00:12:00.520 --> 00:12:02.290
So why did you run away?

00:12:02.760 --> 00:12:06.230
I treated you well.

00:12:09.100 --> 00:12:10.300
The thing is...

00:12:18.540 --> 00:12:20.370
Mom.

00:12:21.910 --> 00:12:23.180
Mother.

00:12:23.580 --> 00:12:24.710
God.

00:12:27.380 --> 00:12:29.150
You've suffered enough, Damhyang.

00:12:29.820 --> 00:12:31.750
It was hard for you.

00:12:43.130 --> 00:12:44.500
Everything is fine.

00:12:47.170 --> 00:12:48.300
Everything will be fine.

00:12:56.640 --> 00:12:59.080
We try to smile in front of her.

00:12:59.610 --> 00:13:01.580
Her Majesty should not

00:13:01.580 --> 00:13:03.320
grieve for a long time.

00:13:03.980 --> 00:13:05.020
Yes.

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:24.640
Your Majesty. It's time to wake up.

00:13:33.550 --> 00:13:34.750
Your Majesty.

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:39.190
Were you unable to sleep last night?

00:13:40.190 --> 00:13:43.160
I'm worried you'll get yourself into trouble.

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:48.590
Too many thoughts, I couldn’t sleep.

00:13:50.860 --> 00:13:53.270
By the way, did they sleep well anyway?

00:13:54.030 --> 00:13:55.540
Who?

00:13:55.540 --> 00:13:57.740
Those people who tried to ruin my life.

00:13:58.200 --> 00:14:00.640
This was their last peaceful sleep.

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:02.610
I hope they got enough sleep.

00:14:05.750 --> 00:14:07.410
-Lady Choi.
-Yes.

00:14:07.580 --> 00:14:09.080
Send someone

00:14:09.080 --> 00:14:10.980
for my father, let him come to the palace.

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:12.350
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:14:23.700 --> 00:14:24.830
Your Majesty.

00:14:25.370 --> 00:14:28.000
Your father has arrived.

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:29.970
Already?

00:14:34.910 --> 00:14:38.110
I was going to ask you to come to the palace.

00:14:39.150 --> 00:14:41.980
But you have already arrived.

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:43.080
Yes.

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:47.720
It seems that I came for a reason.

00:14:51.790 --> 00:14:53.190
-Last time...
-Last time...

00:14:54.130 --> 00:14:55.430
You speak first.

00:14:55.430 --> 00:14:57.330
No. You speak.

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:59.770
No. You speak first.

00:15:05.140 --> 00:15:06.710
-Sorry about that time.
-Sorry about that time.

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:08.640
-No. First I'll apologize.
-No. Me first.

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:10.010
-Me first.
-No, I.

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:11.280
-God.
-Me first.

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:23.260
Yes, blood is not water.

00:15:24.660 --> 00:15:25.960
Exactly.

00:15:28.060 --> 00:15:31.600
I called you today

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:34.230
because of the ledger.

00:15:37.440 --> 00:15:40.240
-Did you know?
-Everyone went crazy because of her.

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:42.440
What kind of book is this?

00:15:46.510 --> 00:15:50.650
This is an account of the illegal activities of our clan.

00:15:51.320 --> 00:15:53.220
The weak point of the Andong Kim clan.

00:15:53.420 --> 00:15:56.160
That's why Cheoljong wanted to get her.

00:15:56.160 --> 00:16:00.260
Today I just came to talk about her.

00:16:01.190 --> 00:16:04.230
After your visit with the king, she disappeared.

00:16:04.700 --> 00:16:07.230
Therefore, all this time I suspected the king.

00:16:08.300 --> 00:16:09.470
But recently

00:16:09.770 --> 00:16:12.510
my faithful servant, whom I doted on, ran away.

00:16:13.470 --> 00:16:16.080
Luckily, I caught it and found out the reason.

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:18.910
The day before the disappearance

00:16:19.710 --> 00:16:21.780
he let concubine Cho in.

00:16:23.420 --> 00:16:25.590
When there was a commotion at home,

00:16:25.890 --> 00:16:28.790
he thought it was all because of him and ran away. Therefore...

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:32.390
I'm sorry.

00:16:35.460 --> 00:16:37.800
It's not your fault.

00:16:39.800 --> 00:16:40.870
Here

00:16:42.170 --> 00:16:44.270
and our riddle was solved.

00:16:46.070 --> 00:16:47.140
What?

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:49.980
Sunwon was the one who initiated my murder.

00:16:50.940 --> 00:16:53.480
I specially prepared ice

00:16:53.480 --> 00:16:55.980
which is more expensive than gold today.

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:00.950
The Queen Mother mocked me.

00:17:01.390 --> 00:17:03.020
I will serve you my food someday.

00:17:03.020 --> 00:17:04.520
I have to try it now.

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:12.170
And Cho Hwajin provided the weapon.

00:17:12.300 --> 00:17:14.170
Confess everything to the king.

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:15.400
Are you threatening me?

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:18.200
I you

00:17:19.440 --> 00:17:20.670
heard clearly.

00:17:30.950 --> 00:17:34.620
Father, I need to go somewhere now.

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:36.560
Where?

00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:40.090
Open the door to the fire pit.

00:17:40.860 --> 00:17:45.700
You will regret contacting me.

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:53.170
She used to be as obedient as a lamb.

00:17:53.610 --> 00:17:56.340
And in a short time here she became cruel.

00:17:57.540 --> 00:18:00.080
I know that parents cannot be objective towards their children.

00:18:00.310 --> 00:18:01.650
But a sheep?

00:18:02.580 --> 00:18:04.420
If I compared her to an animal,

00:18:04.420 --> 00:18:06.250
then only with tarpan.

00:18:07.550 --> 00:18:10.120
My daughter is a Tarpan?

00:18:30.780 --> 00:18:32.250
Maori tattoo.

00:18:33.550 --> 00:18:35.180
Peacock feather.

00:18:35.780 --> 00:18:37.850
And the devil wears Prada.

00:18:38.750 --> 00:18:40.650
There is power in beauty.

00:18:41.420 --> 00:18:46.090
Today I have the most beautiful armor.

00:18:47.360 --> 00:18:48.430
How do you like it?

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:51.430
Like.

00:18:52.870 --> 00:18:54.930
Revenge is sweet when served with fireworks.

00:19:19.430 --> 00:19:21.530
What does it mean?

00:19:22.060 --> 00:19:24.130
What you see is not everything.

00:19:37.280 --> 00:19:38.880
To find out what's inside,

00:19:38.880 --> 00:19:41.180
needs to be cut.

00:19:41.350 --> 00:19:43.520
I thought it was just potatoes.

00:19:44.320 --> 00:19:47.220
But you fooled me.

00:19:47.220 --> 00:19:50.020
You should not lose trust without a good reason.

00:19:50.320 --> 00:19:53.330
You need to make sure what it is before you cut it.

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:58.560
Because after that you won’t get anything back.

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:02.170
Your drinks.

00:20:20.420 --> 00:20:23.120
Today I prepared brunch

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:26.430
to thank you for the recent

00:20:26.690 --> 00:20:28.530
wonderful breakfast.

00:20:29.960 --> 00:20:33.070
The cool drink at last brunch was so great

00:20:34.270 --> 00:20:36.870
that I wouldn't even notice someone's death.

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:46.050
Give it a try.

00:20:51.280 --> 00:20:53.220
I don't feel like drinking.

00:20:53.220 --> 00:20:55.820
I put so much effort into it. Take at least a sip.

00:20:55.820 --> 00:20:57.460
I said that I don’t want to.

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:00.990
I tried so hard.

00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:04.830
If you don't want to drink...

00:21:23.820 --> 00:21:26.150
It really tastes better with ice.

00:21:30.120 --> 00:21:31.860
I said before that I will help you

00:21:32.360 --> 00:21:35.330
stay healthy and young for the rest of your life.

00:21:35.960 --> 00:21:38.500
And I will continue to do so.

00:21:39.170 --> 00:21:42.100
If you doubt food, drinks and everything around you,

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:44.870
then life will turn into nothing but suffering.

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:46.840
Since my regency is over,

00:21:46.840 --> 00:21:48.810
Do you think you can do anything?

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:50.510
Do you think you'll stay

00:21:50.510 --> 00:21:52.680
a queen without her clan?

00:21:52.680 --> 00:21:54.210
The Dowager Queen.

00:21:55.110 --> 00:21:57.250
I don't rely on my clan or my husband.

00:21:58.320 --> 00:22:00.550
I do whatever I want because I can.

00:22:09.560 --> 00:22:11.860
Exactly. Chief Eunuch.

00:22:13.130 --> 00:22:14.300
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:22:14.300 --> 00:22:16.740
I neglected my duty

00:22:16.740 --> 00:22:18.700
produce an heir.

00:22:19.840 --> 00:22:22.680
I think this is unacceptable.

00:22:23.240 --> 00:22:25.580
So go and report to her.

00:22:27.880 --> 00:22:31.350
Report?

00:22:32.180 --> 00:22:35.020
I don't know what you're talking about, Your Majesty.

00:22:36.920 --> 00:22:39.260
You know, you always do this.

00:22:43.300 --> 00:22:44.560
How dare you?

00:22:45.530 --> 00:22:47.170
I should punish you!

00:22:49.600 --> 00:22:51.800
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

00:22:52.170 --> 00:22:54.640
-Kill me.
-What's wrong with you?

00:22:55.470 --> 00:22:57.280
I didn't tell you.

00:23:04.980 --> 00:23:07.650
Now my life is in your hands.

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:10.090
I don't need her.

00:23:10.660 --> 00:23:12.490
What should I do with it?

00:23:13.290 --> 00:23:16.230
Please kill me, Your Majesty.

00:23:16.230 --> 00:23:18.030
God. I said it's not necessary.

00:23:22.700 --> 00:23:24.300
I know you had no choice.

00:23:24.700 --> 00:23:26.340
You must follow orders.

00:23:31.810 --> 00:23:35.810
It would be better if you were angry with me.

00:23:36.950 --> 00:23:39.620
It's scarier.

00:23:42.290 --> 00:23:46.330
How can you be a spy if you're so easily scared?

00:23:48.860 --> 00:23:51.430
I need to go somewhere before the meeting.

00:23:52.200 --> 00:23:54.100
Go to Injeongjeong.

00:23:56.870 --> 00:23:59.640
God, can you read this somewhere else?

00:23:59.640 --> 00:24:01.570
The chief eunuch was so scared.

00:24:23.160 --> 00:24:24.960
Hope you slept well.

00:24:26.670 --> 00:24:29.130
Is this how you greet your elders?

00:24:29.940 --> 00:24:32.000
The stilettos are very heavy.

00:24:32.140 --> 00:24:34.010
I can't bow my head.

00:24:35.540 --> 00:24:38.840
In this sacred place, rituals are performed and ancestors are remembered.

00:24:39.110 --> 00:24:42.580
It's not appropriate to come here hung with jewelry.

00:24:43.650 --> 00:24:47.250
Before you issue a return, you need to clean the feathers.

00:24:49.220 --> 00:24:50.590
Wow, I completely forgot.

00:24:50.860 --> 00:24:53.290
We need to light incense for the deceased king.

00:24:54.730 --> 00:24:58.000
And how could I disgrace the Chonghak teaching on etiquette.

00:25:03.370 --> 00:25:04.600
Stop it.

00:25:04.940 --> 00:25:07.070
I am an ardent follower of Confucianism.

00:25:07.740 --> 00:25:10.010
I can't stand unfulfilled rituals.

00:25:10.840 --> 00:25:12.180
I told you not to touch it.

00:25:13.680 --> 00:25:15.950
You left something in my chambers.

00:25:17.980 --> 00:25:20.920
They showed up unannounced and poked their nose into my affairs.

00:25:23.560 --> 00:25:25.690
About the same as now.

00:25:26.560 --> 00:25:28.330
What are you doing?

00:25:28.960 --> 00:25:31.330
She said so. Return.

00:25:32.160 --> 00:25:34.200
I suffered a lot here - I need to return everything.

00:25:34.800 --> 00:25:37.800
What kind of rude words are you talking?

00:25:38.270 --> 00:25:40.340
Slander your elders

00:25:40.340 --> 00:25:42.470
and complain about life.

00:25:43.440 --> 00:25:44.740
You've always been like this

00:25:44.740 --> 00:25:47.580
but today your temper has crossed all boundaries.

00:25:48.380 --> 00:25:52.750
Is it because you grew up without your mother's hand?

00:25:53.490 --> 00:25:55.290
Hey, mother-in-law.

00:25:57.020 --> 00:25:58.820
If I'm rude because I grew up without a mother,

00:25:59.830 --> 00:26:02.530
then you are impudent because you did not raise your child?

00:26:04.660 --> 00:26:06.000
Hot!

00:26:09.900 --> 00:26:12.470
Everything is so annoying that I can't stand the heat.

00:26:13.770 --> 00:26:15.840
Portrait of your dearest son

00:26:15.840 --> 00:26:17.780
Almost got burned.

00:26:18.540 --> 00:26:20.410
Are you out of your mind?

00:26:21.180 --> 00:26:23.850
Yes, for sure and irrevocably.

00:26:24.750 --> 00:26:27.550
Of all the crazy people, I'm the maddest.

00:26:29.190 --> 00:26:31.060
So go ahead and look around.

00:26:38.760 --> 00:26:41.030
Even if a hair falls from my head,

00:26:44.470 --> 00:26:46.840
and you won’t see your son again.

00:27:17.490 --> 00:27:20.110
It wasn't the queen that was worth worrying about,

00:27:21.540 --> 00:27:23.310
and about all the others.

00:27:30.050 --> 00:27:32.850
The best defense is an attack.

00:27:49.740 --> 00:27:53.710
Wow, I didn’t notice that you were here too.

00:27:54.570 --> 00:27:57.480
There are ghost people.
They walk and do not show any light.

00:27:58.940 --> 00:28:01.450
I'm throwing pancakes into the pond here.
Do you want to come with me?

00:28:01.450 --> 00:28:02.750
Throw it yourself.

00:28:05.180 --> 00:28:06.390
Accounting book.

00:28:07.850 --> 00:28:09.290
You're the one who took it.

00:28:11.220 --> 00:28:13.730
I almost died because of her.

00:28:17.500 --> 00:28:18.530
Tell me.

00:28:20.570 --> 00:28:21.870
Did you achieve this?

00:28:23.400 --> 00:28:25.670
You really didn't kill Ovol?

00:28:27.370 --> 00:28:30.210
No matter what I say, you only believe what you want.

00:28:30.210 --> 00:28:32.040
I must take the king from you,

00:28:32.040 --> 00:28:34.210
kill Ovol and throw her body into the well.

00:28:34.210 --> 00:28:36.320
Then I'll be a villain who deserves to die

00:28:37.280 --> 00:28:39.380
and you are an innocent victim, saint.

00:28:42.820 --> 00:28:45.390
This is why playing the victim is dangerous.

00:28:45.490 --> 00:28:47.130
Slowly turning into a monster -

00:28:49.830 --> 00:28:52.060
and you yourself don’t notice.

00:29:08.650 --> 00:29:09.880
Look in the mirror.

00:29:10.650 --> 00:29:12.280
You will see your ugliness.

00:29:32.640 --> 00:29:34.480
Stay on your own if you want to get out.

00:29:35.210 --> 00:29:37.610
There is no mood for good deeds.

00:29:56.500 --> 00:29:58.630
When I fell into the water before your eyes,

00:30:00.900 --> 00:30:02.130
most likely

00:30:04.370 --> 00:30:06.440
you could have extended your hand to me.

00:30:11.940 --> 00:30:13.050
This proves

00:30:14.250 --> 00:30:16.880
that as a person I am better than you.

00:30:31.530 --> 00:30:33.600
Kim Jwageun, troop commander,

00:30:35.100 --> 00:30:37.100
left his post.

00:30:38.100 --> 00:30:39.370
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:30:40.010 --> 00:30:41.840
The resignation was delayed

00:30:41.840 --> 00:30:44.240
you could all repent for this.

00:30:45.110 --> 00:30:46.180
What a shame.

00:30:49.150 --> 00:30:51.120
Wait, I misspoke.

00:30:51.780 --> 00:30:53.320
What a relief.

00:30:57.720 --> 00:30:59.160
Next question.

00:30:59.160 --> 00:31:02.560
But first I want to announce something.

00:31:04.700 --> 00:31:07.670
I will create an agency that will deal with the system of three taxes.

00:31:07.800 --> 00:31:11.100
It will be called Samjeong Lijeongjeong.

00:31:11.770 --> 00:31:14.610
Samjeong Lijeongjeon?

00:31:16.210 --> 00:31:18.340
It will create laws

00:31:18.340 --> 00:31:20.380
and develop plans to solve

00:31:20.510 --> 00:31:22.780
the main shortcomings of the three-tax system.

00:31:25.550 --> 00:31:27.850
The country lives off agriculture.

00:31:28.690 --> 00:31:30.620
The peasants prosper, and she prospers.

00:31:30.760 --> 00:31:33.830
Officials robbing ordinary farmers

00:31:33.830 --> 00:31:35.760
- a threat to the state.

00:31:36.360 --> 00:31:39.700
Their atrocities will be regarded as treason.

00:31:40.070 --> 00:31:43.500
Before creating a new agency
you need to study everything carefully.

00:31:44.100 --> 00:31:46.510
At least listen to our opinion before...

00:31:46.510 --> 00:31:50.080
I won't make any concessions
doing what you have to do.

00:31:51.410 --> 00:31:52.480
This means

00:31:53.310 --> 00:31:55.950
that your opinion no longer matters.

00:32:03.220 --> 00:32:05.990
I will also give the late King Seongjong

00:32:06.860 --> 00:32:10.600
posthumous name Sunjo, as required by tradition.

00:32:17.170 --> 00:32:20.370
His Majesty is more assertive than usual today.

00:32:27.050 --> 00:32:28.250
Your Majesty.

00:32:28.850 --> 00:32:31.020
Today there is a new appointment.

00:32:31.920 --> 00:32:33.950
The chief secretary misspoke.

00:32:34.620 --> 00:32:36.420
We are talking about a candidate proposal.

00:32:37.720 --> 00:32:40.290
The position of the Minister of War is vacant.

00:32:41.060 --> 00:32:44.500
A weak army will lead to a crisis throughout the country.

00:32:44.500 --> 00:32:46.800
So I insist that you approve

00:32:46.800 --> 00:32:49.470
candidate chosen by the military council.

00:32:50.970 --> 00:32:52.570
The Minister of War is coming.

00:33:15.860 --> 00:33:17.600
Kim Byongin, Minister of War

00:33:20.470 --> 00:33:21.940
Greetings Your Majesty.

00:33:35.750 --> 00:33:39.120
Kim Byungin may be dangerous - he is supported by the Cho family.

00:33:40.390 --> 00:33:41.590
Both Cho and Kim

00:33:41.590 --> 00:33:43.820
asked for him.

00:33:43.960 --> 00:33:45.620
This must be his doing too.

00:33:48.390 --> 00:33:50.830
I don't think we can turn a blind eye to their requests.

00:33:50.830 --> 00:33:54.570
This could give the aristocrats a reason to rebel.

00:33:57.040 --> 00:33:58.540
Now you are free to do

00:33:58.540 --> 00:34:00.310
whatever you want.

00:34:00.310 --> 00:34:02.210
But it is still difficult to stop their attacks.

00:34:02.210 --> 00:34:05.110
The best defense is an attack.

00:34:05.610 --> 00:34:07.010
Need to strike

00:34:07.010 --> 00:34:09.880
faster than your opponent.

00:34:11.450 --> 00:34:13.190
There is no time to recruit more soldiers.

00:34:13.820 --> 00:34:16.250
I want you to take care of Lijonchon.

00:34:16.420 --> 00:34:18.620
Hon, I'll send you

00:34:18.620 --> 00:34:20.090
to 3 cities in the south.

00:34:20.090 --> 00:34:22.560
People there are indignant - start an investigation.

00:34:24.300 --> 00:34:25.600
Another business trip?

00:34:29.600 --> 00:34:30.800
Well, for my sake.

00:34:32.170 --> 00:34:36.010
The further into the forest, the more you are here
the two of you sit and give orders.

00:34:36.010 --> 00:34:38.840
It seems like all the running is on me. Or am I wrong?

00:34:38.840 --> 00:34:41.350
Not just on you. I always...

00:34:43.680 --> 00:34:45.280
When you're done with your investigation,

00:34:46.520 --> 00:34:48.790
-I could give you a vacation.
-I'm leaving.

00:34:49.150 --> 00:34:51.320
I could.

00:34:51.560 --> 00:34:53.260
I said I could.

00:34:53.260 --> 00:34:55.560
I doubt he heard it.

00:34:55.890 --> 00:34:57.400
What an idiot.

00:35:02.500 --> 00:35:03.770
Your Majesty.

00:35:04.200 --> 00:35:07.010
There is a letter for you.

00:35:09.340 --> 00:35:11.180
I won't kill you, come closer.

00:35:18.550 --> 00:35:22.620
The Queen has sent you a letter.

00:35:25.790 --> 00:35:27.630
Are you sick?

00:35:31.360 --> 00:35:32.700
You shake like an autumn leaf.

00:35:36.540 --> 00:35:41.210
Revenge was not what I thought.
It should have been more fun.

00:35:47.110 --> 00:35:48.550
How exciting.

00:35:49.410 --> 00:35:50.450
I'm shaking all over.

00:35:57.860 --> 00:35:59.020
His Majesty...

00:36:06.800 --> 00:36:07.800
You have come.

00:36:13.540 --> 00:36:16.640
Today you are especially beautiful.

00:36:17.280 --> 00:36:18.780
It suits you very well.

00:36:18.940 --> 00:36:20.810
Anything suits a pretty face.

00:36:20.810 --> 00:36:22.580
I’ll be a beauty even in rags.

00:36:23.980 --> 00:36:26.320
Who knew that I would become a great queen?

00:36:29.790 --> 00:36:31.960
I'll never get used to this.

00:36:33.190 --> 00:36:34.990
I asked for a meeting

00:36:37.000 --> 00:36:38.230
to propose an alliance.

00:36:39.600 --> 00:36:42.490
Rod probably left me
thinking that now I'm at one with you.

00:36:42.870 --> 00:36:44.200
I have nothing to lose.

00:36:44.500 --> 00:36:46.400
If you choose my side

00:36:46.770 --> 00:36:48.840
The Kim family will become your enemy.

00:36:48.840 --> 00:36:50.580
They were the first to ditch me.

00:36:50.980 --> 00:36:52.740
Now I'll throw them.

00:36:53.410 --> 00:36:55.040
A common enemy is not a reason to unite?

00:37:05.820 --> 00:37:06.860
Yes.

00:37:09.190 --> 00:37:12.460
From now on, no social distancing.

00:37:12.730 --> 00:37:15.070
Certainly. You can touch everything.

00:37:19.300 --> 00:37:20.540
In films about bandits

00:37:20.540 --> 00:37:22.840
I saw the homies mixing blood in a bowl and drinking.

00:37:23.140 --> 00:37:25.880
But blood is somehow unhygienic.

00:37:26.510 --> 00:37:28.810
Let's celebrate our union with tea.

00:37:28.810 --> 00:37:29.950
Simple and tasteful.

00:37:37.990 --> 00:37:39.020
What?

00:37:41.660 --> 00:37:44.130
Is this how the allies drink?

00:37:44.130 --> 00:37:46.030
Yes, for brotherhood.

00:37:46.030 --> 00:37:48.400
-To the bottom.
-What...

00:37:54.940 --> 00:37:58.380
Since we're brothers, let's clear things up.

00:37:59.210 --> 00:38:00.580
Why did you want to kill me?

00:38:03.350 --> 00:38:04.380
Right.

00:38:05.750 --> 00:38:07.950
It's worth discussing.

00:38:09.890 --> 00:38:11.760
We thought you heard our conversation

00:38:11.760 --> 00:38:13.490
about the assassination attempt on your father.

00:38:14.860 --> 00:38:16.660
He's still your father-in-law.

00:38:16.830 --> 00:38:19.660
For me, he was one of the corrupt officials.

00:38:19.930 --> 00:38:21.300
Heartless.

00:38:21.870 --> 00:38:24.000
Everything is clear with you.
And he didn’t spare his own wife.

00:38:24.300 --> 00:38:25.740
Serial killer Kimov.

00:38:26.740 --> 00:38:27.870
Sorry.

00:38:28.810 --> 00:38:30.810
I know my apologies won't change much

00:38:31.910 --> 00:38:34.050
but there was so much misunderstanding between us.

00:38:35.150 --> 00:38:36.150
OK.

00:38:37.020 --> 00:38:38.580
You'll owe me.

00:38:38.580 --> 00:38:40.290
I won't forgive you until you return the favor.

00:38:42.290 --> 00:38:43.890
So what do you want?

00:38:44.260 --> 00:38:45.360
Strengthen your power?

00:38:45.360 --> 00:38:49.630
This is just a way to restore our destroyed country.

00:38:50.730 --> 00:38:53.400
I don’t think that the foundations of society can be easily changed.

00:38:53.970 --> 00:38:56.530
Honestly, I like the method more than the goal.

00:38:56.840 --> 00:38:58.770
If you strengthen your power,

00:38:59.340 --> 00:39:01.140
then no one will get to me.

00:39:02.710 --> 00:39:05.240
I am well aware of the fear of death.

00:39:06.210 --> 00:39:10.010
I know you're being rude
but you must be scared.

00:39:10.680 --> 00:39:11.680
Don't know.

00:39:12.150 --> 00:39:14.050
Maybe because she was already dying?

00:39:14.050 --> 00:39:15.850
For me, neglect is worse than death.

00:39:16.790 --> 00:39:20.190
If I can give a thrashing to all those who disdain me,

00:39:21.690 --> 00:39:23.500
then I'll die smiling.

00:39:26.100 --> 00:39:27.170
Your Majesty.

00:39:27.570 --> 00:39:30.100
It's time to cook lunch.

00:39:30.100 --> 00:39:32.340
Yes. Well then

00:39:33.940 --> 00:39:35.340
I'm leaving you.

00:39:52.460 --> 00:39:54.390
I'll die smiling.

00:39:55.360 --> 00:39:56.860
"I'll die smiling."

00:40:13.580 --> 00:40:16.410
- Mister Kim.
-Benin.

00:40:17.180 --> 00:40:19.820
That is, the Minister of War.

00:40:20.490 --> 00:40:23.350
-Are you kidding me?
-Why, of course not.

00:40:23.760 --> 00:40:25.520
Please call me by name.

00:40:25.760 --> 00:40:28.090
Actually, I was waiting for you

00:40:29.190 --> 00:40:32.400
because I wanted to talk to you about the queen.

00:40:33.630 --> 00:40:37.870
By the way, I also have something to tell you about her.

00:40:49.280 --> 00:40:51.820
Where did I put this?

00:40:52.420 --> 00:40:54.850
Where to?

00:40:57.190 --> 00:41:00.190
-Wait.
-I saw.

00:41:05.660 --> 00:41:06.660
You!

00:41:07.200 --> 00:41:10.740
How dare you use a knife?
You've been here for almost a week.

00:41:13.200 --> 00:41:15.070
Now everything has changed.

00:41:15.070 --> 00:41:19.640
Lately, chefs have been refusing to drink makgeolli after work.

00:41:19.640 --> 00:41:22.010
They constantly say “no” and “no”.

00:41:22.010 --> 00:41:24.820
I said that I would treat them, but they still refuse.

00:41:24.820 --> 00:41:25.820
Go and understand them.

00:41:26.350 --> 00:41:30.860
I don’t understand these court ladies either.

00:41:31.760 --> 00:41:35.890
I told them to come later, and they really came later.

00:41:35.890 --> 00:41:38.730
They should have arrived early.

00:41:39.500 --> 00:41:41.170
-Well, what kind of children have we gone?
-Well, what kind of children have we gone?

00:41:44.840 --> 00:41:45.970
To the Dongmyeongjong Hall.

00:41:53.610 --> 00:41:54.610
Damn it.

00:41:55.650 --> 00:41:57.680
There's one more thing left to take revenge on.

00:41:58.380 --> 00:41:59.580
A recipe for revenge?

00:42:03.920 --> 00:42:06.060
I can answer him the same, right?

00:42:06.620 --> 00:42:08.460
An eye for an eye. A tooth for a tooth.

00:42:08.860 --> 00:42:10.400
Manhood for manhood.

00:42:11.800 --> 00:42:14.200
Fern then?

00:42:15.700 --> 00:42:17.570
-Busennik?
-Fern and beaded plant.

00:42:17.570 --> 00:42:19.870
This recipe has a lot of healthy ingredients.

00:42:20.310 --> 00:42:22.270
So I will forever go towards my goal.

00:42:22.610 --> 00:42:24.180
This is too long.

00:42:26.440 --> 00:42:27.710
Let's go all in.

00:42:30.010 --> 00:42:31.980
-Castration.
-Castration?

00:42:33.450 --> 00:42:34.620
I didn't hear...

00:42:37.860 --> 00:42:39.490
I see.

00:42:40.190 --> 00:42:41.430
Such a valuable ingredient.

00:42:46.060 --> 00:42:47.830
I don't want to burden you.

00:42:48.430 --> 00:42:51.240
I know when to give up.

00:42:51.840 --> 00:42:53.140
Sorry.

00:42:53.200 --> 00:42:54.340
Don't apologize.

00:42:56.370 --> 00:43:00.110
Can I ask you just one question?

00:43:00.750 --> 00:43:02.750
-Yes.
-Why do you

00:43:03.650 --> 00:43:05.850
Don't like purposeful men?

00:43:08.420 --> 00:43:12.520
I saw a lot of purposeful people in the palace

00:43:13.590 --> 00:43:15.890
and how hard it was for them.

00:43:16.430 --> 00:43:17.960
I'm afraid

00:43:18.630 --> 00:43:20.330
and I don’t want this for myself.

00:43:23.130 --> 00:43:24.740
Thanks for your answer.

00:43:35.050 --> 00:43:38.220
Everything I would dare to want from you,

00:43:39.680 --> 00:43:41.620
so that you always

00:43:42.920 --> 00:43:44.120
smiled.

00:43:44.520 --> 00:43:45.920
Oh, it's you.

00:43:50.600 --> 00:43:51.600
Apparently this is the end.

00:43:51.600 --> 00:43:53.870
You really have a sharp eye.

00:43:54.230 --> 00:43:55.470
You understood everything right away.

00:43:55.630 --> 00:43:58.670
How could I not understand when you cry like that?

00:44:00.270 --> 00:44:01.470
Don't look.

00:44:04.080 --> 00:44:07.410
I don't want to be seen like this.

00:44:08.650 --> 00:44:10.980
Then go around the corner and cry there.

00:44:10.980 --> 00:44:13.420
People will still decide that it's because of me.

00:44:14.320 --> 00:44:15.550
It's not because of me.

00:44:18.760 --> 00:44:20.360
I won't cry anymore.

00:44:21.360 --> 00:44:24.760
Being able to completely get rid of feelings is part of love.

00:44:25.230 --> 00:44:29.170
This may be more difficult than continuing to love her.

00:44:30.000 --> 00:44:31.570
You are truly a poet.

00:44:32.640 --> 00:44:34.940
Let's go. Don't cry.

00:44:40.310 --> 00:44:44.020
Did she send me food on purpose?

00:44:52.160 --> 00:44:53.890
What is this ominous drawing?

00:44:53.890 --> 00:44:57.500
How beautiful it is.

00:44:58.130 --> 00:45:00.730
Court lady Chon, even poison would not take you,

00:45:00.830 --> 00:45:02.500
You're so slow on the uptake.

00:45:03.940 --> 00:45:06.270
Why are you suddenly praising me?

00:45:25.590 --> 00:45:26.890
Your Majesty.

00:45:27.590 --> 00:45:32.900
I, Simon of the Khan family, have come to greet you.

00:45:37.900 --> 00:45:39.770
Haven't we met before?

00:45:44.610 --> 00:45:45.880
I'm so grateful.

00:45:46.810 --> 00:45:49.510
I mean, I... Please forgive me.

00:45:50.750 --> 00:45:53.150
I think you should tell me something else.

00:45:53.480 --> 00:45:54.690
For example,

00:45:55.890 --> 00:45:57.920
"I deserve to die."

00:45:59.190 --> 00:46:02.560
Because of you, I spilled all the popcorn I worked so hard to make.

00:46:02.860 --> 00:46:05.000
Scattered when you sent it flying.

00:46:05.700 --> 00:46:09.600
I had no idea that there was a queen in front of me,

00:46:10.640 --> 00:46:14.570
I committed a serious crime.

00:46:16.710 --> 00:46:18.240
Had no idea it was me?

00:46:20.480 --> 00:46:21.480
Then why did you run away?

00:46:21.480 --> 00:46:23.580
Well, that's because...

00:46:23.580 --> 00:46:26.320
Such a noble man ran after me,

00:46:26.320 --> 00:46:28.050
So I was surprised.

00:46:28.490 --> 00:46:31.720
I had no other reasons.

00:46:31.820 --> 00:46:32.920
Is it true?

00:46:37.530 --> 00:46:39.530
In truth, I called you

00:46:42.830 --> 00:46:44.700
to give you a place at court.

00:46:46.670 --> 00:46:49.710
A good place where you definitely won’t be kicked out

00:46:49.710 --> 00:46:50.780
and they will pay well.

00:46:52.410 --> 00:46:53.980
But you have to lose something.

00:46:55.010 --> 00:46:56.080
What?

00:46:57.920 --> 00:46:59.280
Are you saying that I will lose something?

00:47:00.950 --> 00:47:03.860
When I met you, even if it was short-lived,

00:47:04.090 --> 00:47:05.890
I realized that this position is for you.

00:47:05.890 --> 00:47:07.430
I'm so grateful to you, queen.

00:47:11.130 --> 00:47:12.200
you

00:47:13.300 --> 00:47:14.770
you will become a eunuch.

00:47:14.970 --> 00:47:16.070
What?

00:47:17.500 --> 00:47:19.540
Wait. Just a second.

00:47:19.540 --> 00:47:21.810
Let me go. Hands off.

00:47:23.640 --> 00:47:24.710
Your Majesty.

00:47:25.080 --> 00:47:26.740
Please have mercy.

00:47:26.740 --> 00:47:28.480
Thank you for your boundless generosity.

00:47:28.480 --> 00:47:30.650
But why are you doing this?

00:47:32.080 --> 00:47:33.080
Firstly,

00:47:33.080 --> 00:47:35.650
you forged your identity as a nobleman.

00:47:36.450 --> 00:47:38.260
No. It's not your fault.

00:47:38.290 --> 00:47:40.860
The social structure is to blame for this.

00:47:41.030 --> 00:47:42.460
Right.

00:47:43.830 --> 00:47:44.900
At first. Firstly,

00:47:45.200 --> 00:47:46.960
poisoned the water in the royal kitchen

00:47:46.960 --> 00:47:49.070
and disrupted the royal feast.

00:47:50.530 --> 00:47:51.670
Secondly,

00:47:52.070 --> 00:47:53.740
your descendant is a terrible person.

00:47:55.070 --> 00:47:56.070
Descendant?

00:47:56.270 --> 00:47:59.610
Are you sure you haven't confused him with my ancestor?

00:48:00.480 --> 00:48:01.550
No.

00:48:02.650 --> 00:48:03.750
That's right.

00:48:06.850 --> 00:48:09.290
Your descendant is a terrible person.

00:48:09.690 --> 00:48:11.020
Descendant?

00:48:12.260 --> 00:48:13.490
Your Majesty.

00:48:13.490 --> 00:48:15.460
If I become a eunuch, there will be no descendants.

00:48:15.460 --> 00:48:17.930
If I become a eunuch, there will be no descendants. Your Majesty!

00:48:18.900 --> 00:48:21.230
I will have no descendants.

00:48:21.330 --> 00:48:23.330
Do you have descendants? No?

00:48:23.430 --> 00:48:26.040
I won't have any descendants!

00:48:26.040 --> 00:48:29.370
How so. Queen!

00:48:34.910 --> 00:48:38.520
Your Majesty, the Minister of War has arrived.

00:48:48.730 --> 00:48:49.960
Your Majesty.

00:48:50.630 --> 00:48:52.060
Andon clan Kim.

00:48:52.360 --> 00:48:54.270
I'm sure they're all in cahoots.

00:48:54.970 --> 00:48:57.100
But my dad is also from the Andong family of Kim.

00:48:57.270 --> 00:49:00.470
What? I just called him “my dad.”

00:49:03.710 --> 00:49:05.810
Transference of emotions is dangerous.

00:49:08.110 --> 00:49:11.120
I found out what happened to you after our meeting.

00:49:12.720 --> 00:49:14.120
I didn't know what happened.

00:49:14.650 --> 00:49:16.150
You didn't know

00:49:16.790 --> 00:49:18.090
that they were trying to kill me?

00:49:18.090 --> 00:49:21.190
I am not on my father's side, and I am not part of the Kim family.

00:49:22.090 --> 00:49:24.630
However, you are not free from your father and family.

00:49:26.630 --> 00:49:28.330
Eventually you will understand.

00:49:40.680 --> 00:49:42.550
Enemy or ally?

00:49:53.990 --> 00:49:55.690
How dare he do this to Soyeon?

00:50:01.300 --> 00:50:04.140
Moreover, how could he do this to the queen?

00:50:07.410 --> 00:50:09.010
Kim Jwageun, you bastard.

00:50:09.910 --> 00:50:11.310
I have to...

00:50:20.750 --> 00:50:23.220
Besides, this Samjeong Lijeongjeong.

00:50:23.220 --> 00:50:26.990
They use official corruption as an excuse

00:50:26.990 --> 00:50:29.690
to try to destroy our family.

00:50:29.690 --> 00:50:31.030
Don't worry.

00:50:31.660 --> 00:50:34.230
If they see this as appropriation of someone else's property,

00:50:34.230 --> 00:50:36.070
then no one is innocent.

00:50:37.070 --> 00:50:39.440
To protect yourself

00:50:39.700 --> 00:50:41.940
they will try to protect officials too.

00:50:42.170 --> 00:50:45.810
All that will remain of the Samjeong Lijeongjeong is its outer shell.

00:50:49.150 --> 00:50:51.150
Even if you join them for a while,

00:50:51.150 --> 00:50:53.980
Keep your eyes on the Queen Mother.

00:50:54.450 --> 00:50:56.850
She can smile in your face

00:50:56.850 --> 00:50:58.960
but she is always ready to stab her in the back.

00:50:59.890 --> 00:51:01.360
I will remember this.

00:51:02.260 --> 00:51:03.490
Court lady Chon.

00:51:04.230 --> 00:51:06.100
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:51:06.830 --> 00:51:09.330
Clear the table and call the doctor.

00:51:09.570 --> 00:51:11.200
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:51:15.040 --> 00:51:16.510
Have you eaten yet?

00:51:17.440 --> 00:51:19.240
I have no appetite.

00:51:20.140 --> 00:51:22.080
I heard you liked the food

00:51:22.080 --> 00:51:23.850
cooked by the queen.

00:51:25.120 --> 00:51:26.880
She wasn't that good.

00:51:26.980 --> 00:51:29.120
It was edible.

00:51:29.550 --> 00:51:31.960
The Queen is grieving now.

00:51:34.490 --> 00:51:36.290
She said that the main concubine

00:51:36.290 --> 00:51:39.300
came between you and made her believe that the family had turned against her.

00:51:39.630 --> 00:51:41.470
She blames herself for everything.

00:51:43.830 --> 00:51:45.040
Main concubine?

00:51:45.040 --> 00:51:47.100
The queen's father told me today.

00:51:47.470 --> 00:51:49.810
It was not the queen who deceived you,

00:51:51.040 --> 00:51:52.280
and the main concubine.

00:52:01.790 --> 00:52:04.050
The king has granted.

00:52:05.760 --> 00:52:07.020
Ask him to come in.

00:52:14.400 --> 00:52:15.470
Your Majesty.

00:52:15.700 --> 00:52:18.400
Sorry for the late visit without warning.

00:52:19.300 --> 00:52:20.500
Everything is fine.

00:52:20.740 --> 00:52:23.410
It's a huge honor any time.

00:52:23.940 --> 00:52:25.940
I came to say something.

00:52:28.780 --> 00:52:30.380
So what?

00:52:31.120 --> 00:52:34.490
Regarding the body of a court maid recently found in a well.

00:52:35.950 --> 00:52:38.760
This was done by order of the Queen Mother.

00:52:40.090 --> 00:52:41.430
Queen Mothers?

00:52:42.890 --> 00:52:44.160
But why would she...

00:52:44.460 --> 00:52:46.200
You also can’t understand the reason?

00:52:48.900 --> 00:52:51.300
If so, that's for sure...

00:52:51.540 --> 00:52:52.840
It can't be Ovol.

00:52:52.970 --> 00:52:56.140
But this is impossible. This is definitely Ovol.

00:52:56.710 --> 00:52:58.980
I heard it was in such a state
which is difficult to identify.

00:52:58.980 --> 00:53:01.010
Why did you decide that it was Ovol?

00:53:01.550 --> 00:53:03.710
She was dressed as a court lady,

00:53:03.710 --> 00:53:07.480
and of the court ladies, only Ovol disappeared.

00:53:10.750 --> 00:53:13.360
She knew that you would think it was Ovol.

00:53:14.430 --> 00:53:16.130
The Queen Mother wants

00:53:17.090 --> 00:53:19.260
for you to rely on her.

00:53:20.200 --> 00:53:22.370
But why was the well used?

00:53:24.300 --> 00:53:26.740
I told her what I went through in the well.

00:53:27.970 --> 00:53:31.510
That I met you in it.

00:53:31.710 --> 00:53:33.310
And that this place hurts me.

00:53:34.910 --> 00:53:36.680
He reminded me of you

00:53:36.680 --> 00:53:38.980
so I was sure that I had lost someone dear to me.

00:53:41.420 --> 00:53:43.950
Now I understand that you can’t carelessly reveal your pain.

00:53:45.160 --> 00:53:46.420
to anyone in the palace.

00:54:04.840 --> 00:54:08.980
Plunge the queen into the nightmare I live in.

00:54:15.620 --> 00:54:18.160
Trust the Queen Mother no more.

00:54:18.820 --> 00:54:20.160
We must hide what we all know

00:54:21.130 --> 00:54:23.730
so don’t let her know that you know what she did.

00:54:25.630 --> 00:54:29.170
She betrayed me and I am deeply disappointed.

00:54:30.800 --> 00:54:32.070
Well for me

00:54:33.300 --> 00:54:35.470
source of fear.

00:54:37.040 --> 00:54:38.640
I can't believe she used that.

00:54:52.290 --> 00:54:55.490
It's similar to poker and hato.

00:54:55.730 --> 00:54:57.930
Chatting and games -

00:54:57.930 --> 00:55:00.860
the best way to pass the time and life.

00:55:01.730 --> 00:55:03.270
Glad to hear that.

00:55:03.630 --> 00:55:06.370
We were afraid that Damhyang would make you feel bad.

00:55:08.570 --> 00:55:09.810
Oh, sorry.

00:55:11.010 --> 00:55:13.480
Don't worry. She's in a good place now.

00:55:13.710 --> 00:55:16.710
Is it true? She had to go to a good place, right?

00:55:17.880 --> 00:55:18.920
Damhyang.

00:55:21.020 --> 00:55:25.560
No, that's not what I mean. She's really in a good place.

00:55:25.560 --> 00:55:26.620
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:55:28.560 --> 00:55:29.630
Damhyang.

00:55:32.000 --> 00:55:34.060
She said she really moved to a good place.

00:55:35.400 --> 00:55:37.740
Why are you crying?

00:55:39.270 --> 00:55:40.900
I'm sorry.

00:55:41.670 --> 00:55:43.140
If you think about it

00:55:44.140 --> 00:55:47.210
I didn’t even say goodbye to her.

00:55:48.410 --> 00:55:50.850
Damhyang.

00:55:55.120 --> 00:55:57.250
-Damhyang.
-Queen.

00:55:58.720 --> 00:55:59.990
Damhyang.

00:56:00.490 --> 00:56:01.560
Seven.

00:56:03.730 --> 00:56:04.730
Eight.

00:56:05.500 --> 00:56:06.660
This is...

00:56:07.900 --> 00:56:09.800
nine.

00:56:14.100 --> 00:56:16.070
Forgive me.

00:56:16.310 --> 00:56:18.010
How so?

00:56:19.710 --> 00:56:23.110
-Damhyang.
-Damhyang.

00:56:24.650 --> 00:56:25.650
All-in.

00:56:29.850 --> 00:56:32.790
How did the Queen Mother get her hands on the ledger?

00:56:32.890 --> 00:56:35.590
The book we searched so hard for but missed.

00:56:36.920 --> 00:56:40.690
Maybe he could win her over to your side?

00:56:42.260 --> 00:56:43.530
Joke.

00:56:44.230 --> 00:56:47.400
Hearing that she had galloped ahead of us, who were freely leaving the palace,

00:56:47.400 --> 00:56:48.670
I was disappointed in myself.

00:56:49.800 --> 00:56:52.170
The Queen Mother is almost
all the time in the Seongwonjong Hall.

00:56:52.170 --> 00:56:54.470
I don't understand how she got her hands on the ledger.

00:56:54.810 --> 00:56:56.540
This and that she did with the body,

00:56:57.010 --> 00:56:59.750
means she has accomplices.

00:56:59.750 --> 00:57:02.180
Maybe we can make them our accomplices?

00:57:02.850 --> 00:57:05.490
Is the portrait of the one in the tokkaebi mask not ready yet?

00:57:06.020 --> 00:57:08.860
I've been too busy these days

00:57:08.860 --> 00:57:11.220
freeing Damhyang's mother from slavery

00:57:11.220 --> 00:57:13.160
and looking for her father.

00:57:13.330 --> 00:57:14.930
But you never found him, did you?

00:57:14.930 --> 00:57:17.300
How to find someone hiding in the mountains?

00:57:17.600 --> 00:57:19.300
He probably became a bandit.

00:57:23.000 --> 00:57:28.580
Thinking about a holiday after a trip as a royal investigator,

00:57:29.010 --> 00:57:33.310
I can barely stand these days.

00:57:34.510 --> 00:57:36.920
Actually, what I meant was...

00:57:40.490 --> 00:57:44.090
Can you make me a secret inspector instead of a royal investigator?

00:57:44.090 --> 00:57:45.660
This is cooler.

00:57:45.660 --> 00:57:48.560
Having disguised myself, I would suddenly take out a token, like this!

00:57:50.230 --> 00:57:53.100
Yes, you are a born secret inspector. Do as you please.

00:57:54.230 --> 00:57:55.300
One more time.

00:58:21.430 --> 00:58:25.700
I don't think Youngjin is that kind of person.

00:58:26.100 --> 00:58:28.200
Only Kim Jwageun deserved to die.

00:58:28.200 --> 00:58:29.300
And Youngjin -

00:58:31.870 --> 00:58:33.810
my whole family.

00:58:45.990 --> 00:58:48.920
Hey, you'll sleep here after that

00:58:48.920 --> 00:58:50.160
how he almost killed his father-in-law and wife?

00:58:52.360 --> 00:58:53.490
Apparently not.

00:59:10.240 --> 00:59:12.350
Heart, stop it.

00:59:12.980 --> 00:59:14.820
It hurts my pride.

01:00:18.550 --> 01:00:20.880
Looks like she's been underwater for a long time.

01:00:22.250 --> 01:00:25.250
I understand how painful it must be.

01:00:27.950 --> 01:00:30.690
The fact that her body was found in a well is either a terrible coincidence,

01:00:31.060 --> 01:00:33.290
or someone wants to push us.

01:00:50.280 --> 01:00:51.850
I thought deeply.

01:00:52.210 --> 01:00:53.680
You must be very shocked.

01:00:53.980 --> 01:00:55.880
There's too much space here for me.

01:00:57.020 --> 01:01:00.650
Here you feel lonely and lost.

01:01:00.990 --> 01:01:03.920
I found the maid who sold the noriga that you gave Ovol.

01:01:04.490 --> 01:01:06.890
She said she found it in the palace.

01:01:08.700 --> 01:01:09.960
Is that so?

01:01:09.960 --> 01:01:11.600
This is the same maid who threw the body into the well

01:01:11.600 --> 01:01:13.930
by order of the Queen Mother.

01:01:14.670 --> 01:01:16.100
Ovol is alive.

01:01:16.600 --> 01:01:18.470
She was attacked in the palace.

01:01:19.340 --> 01:01:21.680
She didn’t even have time to take a step outside the palace.

01:01:23.910 --> 01:01:25.410
Didn't you hope that the body

01:01:25.950 --> 01:01:28.080
What was found in the well did not belong to Ovol?

01:01:29.350 --> 01:01:31.420
Shouldn't you be happy?

01:01:31.420 --> 01:01:33.090
that it was not Ovol?

01:01:33.950 --> 01:01:36.420
Why do you believe that this is Ovol?

01:01:36.660 --> 01:01:37.790
For God's sake...

01:01:40.690 --> 01:01:42.730
For God's sake, what are you hiding?

01:01:47.230 --> 01:01:48.270
Last time

01:01:50.670 --> 01:01:53.310
what did you convey

01:01:55.080 --> 01:01:56.410
Queen Mother?

01:02:07.190 --> 01:02:08.560
Have you seen everything?

01:02:09.290 --> 01:02:10.360
I

01:02:11.320 --> 01:02:15.800
I don't see anything without your permission.

01:02:20.570 --> 01:02:22.500
Everyone goes astray at times.

01:02:22.940 --> 01:02:24.940
You still have a chance to get back on the right track.

01:02:28.140 --> 01:02:30.410
What if I've lost my way a long time ago?

01:02:31.780 --> 01:02:32.910
I still can

01:02:34.210 --> 01:02:36.320
back on track?

01:02:39.750 --> 01:02:41.320
There is no turning back.

01:02:41.690 --> 01:02:42.920
Your Highness.

01:02:42.920 --> 01:02:45.660
That body must be Ovol.

01:02:55.800 --> 01:02:58.140
Why do you make Samhyang Ramen?

01:02:58.840 --> 01:03:00.340
in the middle of the night?

01:03:04.010 --> 01:03:06.580
Why do you want it most at night?

01:03:06.580 --> 01:03:09.120
You know that your face will be swollen in the morning.

01:03:09.680 --> 01:03:12.920
But it is so difficult to fight temptation.

01:03:15.490 --> 01:03:18.090
You tried so hard, it's a shame it was in vain.

01:03:18.090 --> 01:03:20.160
Queen Dowager at night

01:03:20.290 --> 01:03:21.900
doesn't eat.

01:03:21.900 --> 01:03:23.600
So instead let me...

01:03:25.870 --> 01:03:27.030
No.

01:03:55.860 --> 01:03:58.230
You must warn me when you are coming.

01:03:58.230 --> 01:04:00.670
Why didn't you even knock?

01:04:07.940 --> 01:04:10.710
Do you want us to eat some ramen before we leave?

01:04:14.410 --> 01:04:17.750
What is ramen? And where do you want me to go?

01:04:18.820 --> 01:04:21.790
No pressure. This is just research.

01:04:21.960 --> 01:04:23.190
Or a test.

01:04:24.120 --> 01:04:26.090
No, I shouldn't do that.

01:04:28.230 --> 01:04:29.800
But if only a little...

01:04:29.800 --> 01:04:30.800
No, no.

01:04:31.000 --> 01:04:33.130
Ramen has such an addictive taste.

01:04:33.130 --> 01:04:35.300
Once you start, it’s impossible to stop.

01:04:36.840 --> 01:04:38.100
What are you doing?

01:04:42.710 --> 01:04:44.180
Internal conflict.

01:04:51.550 --> 01:04:53.150
What would you do if you were me?

01:04:53.520 --> 01:04:56.260
Would you eat ramen or not?

01:04:56.690 --> 01:04:59.230
I think I would first explain what ramen is.

01:05:01.760 --> 01:05:03.730
-For starters...
-What?

01:05:04.460 --> 01:05:05.670
I'll try it.

01:05:06.200 --> 01:05:07.230
Is it true?

01:05:07.730 --> 01:05:09.870
You will only understand what it is when you try it.

01:05:09.870 --> 01:05:11.810
It's like air when you get drunk

01:05:11.810 --> 01:05:13.340
or when you're angry,

01:05:13.340 --> 01:05:15.040
or realize what it is

01:05:16.580 --> 01:05:18.040
reality.

01:05:19.550 --> 01:05:22.120
Are we speaking the same language now?

01:05:22.980 --> 01:05:24.020
Certainly.

01:05:24.550 --> 01:05:26.490
We're talking about ramen.

01:05:28.350 --> 01:05:31.290
Move closer. Ramen is good when it's hot.

01:05:31.290 --> 01:05:32.460
Initial Instruction for Children

01:05:33.630 --> 01:05:34.730
How do you treat her?

01:05:34.930 --> 01:05:36.530
Oh, mommies!

01:05:36.530 --> 01:05:38.400
What to do? This is a priceless book.

01:05:54.550 --> 01:05:57.020
Why did you say this book is priceless?

01:05:59.220 --> 01:06:02.960
Why is Primary Instruction for Children valuable to you?

01:06:05.130 --> 01:06:06.190
This is...

01:06:08.030 --> 01:06:09.260
Was it you?

01:06:12.370 --> 01:06:15.100
The one who saved me was you?

01:06:15.270 --> 01:06:17.770
Did you save me from the well?

01:06:31.080 --> 01:06:32.090
Yes.

01:06:32.890 --> 01:06:33.990
It was me.

01:06:47.100 --> 01:06:51.500
How I became queen

01:07:11.790 --> 01:07:14.960
My Cheoljong will be desperately waiting for me.

01:07:15.300 --> 01:07:17.230
So is this a trap?

01:07:17.230 --> 01:07:20.300
I can't believe the queen challenged me to a real fight.

01:07:20.300 --> 01:07:21.840
-Now is it my turn?
-Take out your sword.

01:07:21.840 --> 01:07:25.000
The one who doesn’t clean up after himself and leaves traces,

01:07:25.000 --> 01:07:26.940
must answer for everything.

01:07:26.940 --> 01:07:28.010
Even though I overthrew the Kim clan,

01:07:28.010 --> 01:07:29.910
Kim Byonin's power only grew stronger.

01:07:29.910 --> 01:07:31.780
It feels like there is no progress.

01:07:31.780 --> 01:07:34.950
If Cheoljong does this, the world will also change 200 years later.

01:07:34.950 --> 01:07:36.980
As long as I'm on your side, you will win.

01:07:36.980 --> 01:07:38.750
I have a secret weapon.

01:07:38.750 --> 01:07:40.090
I know the future.
